{"sourceUrl":"https://marx.hit.edu.cn/2025/0719/c10001a374398/page.htm","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:59:55.049620+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://marx.hit.edu.cn/2025/0719/c10001a374398/page.htm","html":"<div><p><br/></p><p><span>诚挚欢迎全国各高校的优秀应届本科毕业生通过推荐免试方式来我院攻读硕士学位研究生。</span><span>为便于推免生申请，</span><span>说明</span><span>如下：</span></p><p><strong><span>1、专业基本修业年限</span></strong><strong></strong></p><p><span>马克思主义理论，基本修业年限是三年。</span></p><p><strong><span>2、申请条件</span></strong><strong></strong></p><p><span>在满足我校接收推免生的相关要求基础上，本科毕业专业要求为哲学、思想政治教育、历史学、政治学</span><span>或</span><span>其他</span><span>文科</span><span>相近专业。</span></p><p><strong><span>3、审核流程</span></strong><strong></strong></p><p><span>根据学校的统一安排，</span><span>拟</span><span><span>参加我院</span><span>2026年推免预选拔的</span></span><span>同学，</span><span>须</span><span>登录</span><span><span>我校</span><span>“推免预报名系统”（网址：http://yzb.hit.edu.cn）进行预报名。</span></span><strong></strong></p><p><span><span>（</span><span>1）审核时间：申请人在完成预报名后，学院将分</span></span><span>两</span><span>批进行集中审核。</span></p><p><span><span>（</span><span>2）通知形式：学院将通过预报名系统及电话或短信分批次</span></span><span>向</span><span>学生</span><span>反馈审核结果</span><span>，具体通知时间：</span></p><p><span>第一批</span><span>：</span><span> <span>2025年</span></span><span>9</span><span>月</span><span>1</span><span>日</span><span>—</span><span>5</span><span>日</span></p><p><span>第二批：</span><span> </span><span>2025年9月</span><span>6</span><span>日</span><span>—</span><span>12</span><span>日</span></p><p><span>具体时间根据学生报名情况</span><span>可能进行适当调整</span><span>。</span></p><p><strong><span>4、面试安排</span></strong><strong></strong></p><p><span><span>（</span><span>1）面试时间与方式（以</span></span><span>学院后续</span><span>通知为准）。</span></p><p><span><span>（</span><span>2）面试所需其他材料</span></span><span>及其提交方式详见学校通知。</span></p><p><span><span>（</span><span>3）面试内容：学生简述</span></span><span>个人基本</span><span>情况（中英文任选其一），重点讲述自己的突出特色或学习、工作业绩；评委考查内容包括外语能力、专业知识、科研能力和综合素质等</span><span>方面</span><span>。</span></p><p><strong><span>5、联系方式</span></strong><strong></strong></p><p><span>学院联系人：孟宪奎老师</span><span>   <span>联系电话：</span><span>0451-86</span></span><span>210495</span></p><p><span>邮箱：</span><strong><span> </span></strong><a href=\"mailto:mengxiankui@hit.edu.cn\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span><span>mengxiankui@hit.edu.cn</span></span></a></p><p><span>其他未尽事宜按学校相关文件及规定执行，有问题请及时咨询我院。</span></p><p><span> </span></p><p><span>  </span><span>                               </span></p><p><span>                                                                     <span>哈尔滨工业大学马克思主义学院</span></span></p><p><span>                                                                                              <span>2025</span></span><span>年</span><span>7</span><span>月</span><span>1</span><span>9</span><span>日</span></p><p><br/></p></div>","textSha256":"a274c5842be98de1e7d9fbe062663ecb4c4ba3d10d11fc8c91e3e326155d1adb","textLength":599,"sourceSha256":"0c84eefa5fac69603e8a16985a47948a8f30c5604fd8cd4250c42709ca3fef10","selector":".wp_articlecontent","attachments":[],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-c9a5e994ebacf1437de9","title":"2025年哈尔滨工业大学马克思主义学院2026年推免生报名通知","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T16:59:55.049620+00:00"}
